{'symbol': 'LNT', 'date': '2022-07-15 12:30:00', 'title': 'ALLIANT ENERGY CORPORATION DECLARES QUARTERLY COMMON STOCK DIVIDEND', 'text': 'MADISON, WIS., JULY 15, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- THE ALLIANT ENERGY CORPORATION (NASDAQ: LNT) BOARD OF DIRECTORS TODAY DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.4275 PER SHARE PAYABLE ON AUGUST 15, 2022, TO SHAREOWNERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON JULY 29, 2022.'}